    "title": "Professional Self Publishing Services: What Independent Authors Should Know",
    "excerpt": "Professional self publishing services are commercial services that help authors prepare and release books without using the full production structure of a traditional publishing house. They may include manuscript assessment, editing, cover design, interior formatting, eBook conversion, account setup, printing, and distribution.",
    "category": "Publishing",
    "date": "September 03, 2026",
