    "title": "How to Turn Blog Posts Into a Published Book",
    "excerpt": "A successful blog can contain years of useful ideas. You may already have detailed guides, personal stories, reader questions, case studies, and practical advice. Here is a step-by-step roadmap to repurpose your posts into a book.",
